  unitName: Grand Water Golem
  unitId: 87202603
  unitNumber: 7014
  description: Greater Golems that survive the alien corruption of Distilled Ethers
    for more than a month start resonating with the soul energy of ancient Whispering
    Shards discovered in the deepest depths of Orebus. Giselle joined in Noel's experiments
    and together they discovered a special Evolution formula after pouring over ancient
    Orebi Tomes. This breakthrough resulted in the birth of the Grand Golems that
    are able to elevate the bonds of Summoned units to new pinnacles of power.
